+> STOP. Captain's notes: non-binding. Captain writes, Captain trims. Anyone else: close this file now.
+
+# Captain Notes
+
+Binding behaviour lives in `.feature` specs and referenced `assets/**`. History lives in git. These notes carry only what the next cycle needs.
+
+## Voyage 1: TodoMVC vanilla JS
+
+**Goal:** Build a complete TodoMVC app per `assets/app-spec.md`, using `assets/app-template.index.html` as the base markup. Vanilla JavaScript, no preprocessors, persists to localStorage.
+
+**Stack:** JavaScript, browser DOM, npm for dev tooling only.
+
+**Key decisions:**
+- No framework. Plain DOM manipulation with event delegation.
+- Routing via `hashchange` event. No routing library.
+- localStorage key: `todos-vanillajs`.
+- Verification tier: happy-dom (the harness is already wired for it in `features/support/world.js`).
+- `index.html` at project root, copied from the template with sample items removed and `js/app.js` wired in.
+
+**Assets:** `assets/app-spec.md` (TodoMVC spec), `assets/app-template.index.html` (base markup). These are human-owned product material under Captain custody.
