diff --git a/features/add-todo.feature b/features/add-todo.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..bba6abc
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/add-todo.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@
+Feature: Add a todo
+  As a user
+  I want to enter a new todo in the input field
+  So that I can track something I need to do
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Scenario: Creating a todo from a non-empty trimmed input
+    When the user types "Buy milk" into the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list contains 1 item
+    And the todo at position 1 has title "Buy milk"
+    And the new-todo input is empty
+
+  Scenario: Trimming whitespace before creating a todo
+    When the user types "  Buy milk  " into the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo at position 1 has title "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Pressing Enter on an empty or whitespace-only input does nothing
+    When the user types "" into the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list contains 0 items
+    When the user types "   " into the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list contains 0 items
+
+  Scenario: Multiple todos are appended in order
+    When the user types "First" into the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    And the user types "Second" into the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list contains 2 items
+    And the todo at position 1 has title "First"
+    And the todo at position 2 has title "Second"
