+
+  Scenario: Main and footer are hidden when there are no todos
+    Then the main section is hidden
+    And the footer is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer appear when a todo is added
+    When the user types "Buy milk" into the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the main section is visible
+    And the footer is visible
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer hide when the last todo is removed
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When the user clicks the destroy button on todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the main section is hidden
+    And the footer is hidden
